  "label": "Coffee spill as a meme trope",
  "description": "The image leverages the common internet meme trope of a coffee spill being used to represent a minor, often self-deprecating, mishap. This trope relies on cultural understanding of workplace humor and the relatability of coffee-related accidents. It is not visible in the image but is essential to interpret the humor.",
